  "instructions": [
    "Season the lamb shoulder with salt and pepper.",
    "Heat olive oil in a large pot over medium heat and brown the lamb on all sides, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add minced shallots and garlic, sauté until fragrant, 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in Dijon mustard, soy sauce, mirin, and 1 cup water; bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat, cover, and cook the lamb until tender, 30 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, cook soba noodles according to package, then drain and set aside.",
    "Remove the lamb, shred it with two forks, and return to the pot to coat in sauce.",
    "Toss the cooked noodles with the lamb, sauce, and chopped parsley.",
